<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage falls to 9.588 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage falls to 9.588 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market fell back to 9.588 billion rand on Tuesday from 10.275 billion rand on Monday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
</text>
